OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 29 MAR
OL,4,G1100FPaddy McGuinness
OL,5,     GPaddy is live from Salford,
OL,6,     Gasking you about the things
OL,7,     Gyou've never tried before...
OL,8,     GWhether it's food, an adventure
OL,9,     Gsport or even a social media.
OL,10,G1300FBig Night of Musicals
OL,11,     GA celebration of musical theatre
OL,12,     Ghosted by Michelle Visage, packed
OL,13,     Gfull of showstoppers and special
OL,14,     Gguest appearances direct from the
OL,15,     GAO Arena in Manchester.
OL,16,G1500FSounds of the 70s with Shaun
OL,17,     FKeaveny
OL,18,     GMore great tracks from the 70s.
OL,19,     GAlso on the show, more tracks
OL,20,     Gfrom Bob's 'Rock Date Diary' plus
OL,21,     Ganother 70s Country Classic pick.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
